            // least one IFF-factual canonical PersonGlobals brain BHAV (8303 'do idle and mood' /
            // 8301 'do idle' / 8229 'do idle core' / 8275 'process mood' / 8219 'check hunger')
            // identity observed executing in-loop. IFF anchors verified via tools/dump_iff_bhavs.py
            // on the staged PersonGlobals.iff; ids are byte-factual there.
