                        ? " (chancetrace enabled: follow the shift to the 4103 Chance Card fork and the card dialog)"
                        : CheckEnabled("schoolreturn")
                        ? " (schoolreturn enabled: follow the original child/school-bus day through return-home)"
                        : CheckEnabled("schoolmiss")
                        ? " (schoolmiss enabled: the authored bus action loses its queue spot so the missed-school law (4117 grade +3) fires naturally)"
                        : " (no clock jump; natural ~1 sim-min/sec wait)"));
